### Student Applies to Job (login as student first)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/applications/jobs/fde780e3-8b22-44dd-a4eb-db4076f21a1f/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coverLetter": "I am very interested in this position and believe I would be a great fit."
}

### Student Views Their Applications
GET http://localhost:5000/api/applications/my-applications

### Employer Views Applications for a Job (login as employer first)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/applications/jobs/fde780e3-8b22-44dd-a4eb-db4076f21a1f/applications

### Employer Updates Application Status (paste application id)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/applications/e092f79b-e6cf-4ab0-9c3d-78f54b09c5ab/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "shortlisted"
}

### Get My Jobs
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/employer/my-jobs